@startuml
title Control-Station (CS) Decision Logic State Machine

[*] --> Idle

Idle --> LongRangeDetection : RADAR Tracks available
LongRangeDetection --> TrackFusion : A-UAV MAVLink\npositions received
TrackFusion --> ProbabilityCalculation : Consolidated tracks ready

ProbabilityCalculation --> Idle : Probability < Threshold
ProbabilityCalculation --> MissionStart : Probability >= Threshold

MissionStart --> MissionMonitoring : Send Start Command\n+ Initial Abfangbereich

MissionMonitoring --> MissionMonitoring : Update Abfangbereich\n(Operator or Auto)
MissionMonitoring --> MissionMonitoring : Receive A-UAV status\n(MAVLink)
MissionMonitoring --> MissionMonitoring : Detect Z-UAV approach

MissionMonitoring --> MissionEnd : Interception complete
MissionMonitoring --> MissionAbort : Operator aborts mission

MissionAbort --> Landing : Send Land Command
MissionEnd --> Landing : Send Land Command

Landing --> Idle : All A-UAVs landed

@enduml
